dtkmultimedia (6.0.5) unstable; urgency=medium

  * fix(debian): fix tablerecognizer packaging dependencies
  * test(tablerecognizer): keep ut_tableerrorutils out of ut-dtkmultimedia
  * feat(tablerecognizer): add pkg-config/cmake/pri export and deb packaging
