  * refactor(bench): move bench/ to examples/bench/ and fix pre-existing build issues
  * fix(bench): add context QObject to functor-based connect
  * bench: add multi-architecture benchmark suite
  * feat(tablerecognizer): add timing fields and bench CLI for speed testing
  * fix(tablerecognizer): add structure-content consistency routing
  * fix(tablerecognizer): output quality and accuracy fixes
  * fix(tablerecognizer): timeout race condition and OCR timeout handling
  * test(tablerecognizer): add unit tests for DTableRecognizer and Img2TableFallback
  * feat(tablerecognizer): add table recognition pipeline with OCR fallback
  * feat(tablerecognizer): add HtmlTableBuilder for HTML table output generation
  * feat(tablerecognizer): add CellTextMapper for text-box to cell coordinate mapping
  * feat(tablerecognizer): add DtkOcrWrapper for OCR engine abstraction
  * feat(tablerecognizer): add ort table structure detection base module
  * feat(ppocr-v5): 从 CTC 解码结果生成逐字框
  * chore(CI): add debian check workflow
  * Multiple fixes (#78)
  * fix: Drop set_vulkan_compute method
  * feat: Support ffmpeg 7
  * feat: Enhance DGstPlayerProxy for Qt6 support
  * feat: Update video encoding/decoding to use FFmpeg's new API

